This file records details of all data files in the data_input folder.

Rayyan_take3_export_articles.csv - Ruby Stephens - 2024-11-12 - Exported articles with labels and tags from third round of article screening for systematic review.

solar_nationalmap_20241203 and wind_nationalmap_20241203 - National Map - Ruby Stephens - 2024-12-03 - data downloaded from nationalmap.gov.au on locations and power generation of wind and solar facilities in the National Energy Market (southeast Australia)

ibra7_biomes_background.shp - created 2021-03-05 - updated 2021-03-22 - IBRA7 regions file, manually updated with biomes from WWF 2001 Olsen/2017 Dinerstein study, simplified using JSON script to help R display more easily (not suitable for detailed analysis)

tidy_reneweconomy_solarfarms.json - Renew Economy - added 2024-12-20 - data extracted from https://reneweconomy.com.au/large-scale-solar-farm-map-of-australia/ which shows location, size category and operational status of large scale solar facilities of 10 MW or above across Australia. “Operating” includes those projects currently working while “Construction” refers to those currently being built or awaiting commissioning or have signed off-take contracts. All MW capacity measures are in AC rather than DC. No details on website for how map created but notes in data suggest it was manually compiled. This version of json was tidied into readable format using javascript run in browser on original json data from website.

tidy_reneweconomy_windfarms.json - Renew Economy - added 2024-12-20 - data extracted from https://reneweconomy.com.au/large-scale-wind-farm-map-of-australia/ which shows location, size category and operational status of large scale wind facilities of 10 MW or above across Australia. “Operating” includes those projects currently working while “Construction” refers to those currently being built or awaiting commissioning or have signed off-take contracts. No details on website for how map created but notes in data suggest it was manually compiled. This version of json was tidied into readable format using javascript run in browser on original json data from website.

solarfarms_aus_updated.csv - Renew Economy and Ruby Stephens - added 2024-12-20 - data extracted from Renew Economy website and then manually updated by checking lat/longs against satellite imagery and project details against details on project websites etc

windfarms_aus_updated.csv - Renew Economy and Ruby Stephens - added 2024-12-20 - data extracted from Renew Economy website and then manually updated by checking lat/longs against satellite imagery and project details against details on project websites etc

Global-Solar-Power-Tracker-June-2024-v2.xlsx - Global Energy Monitor - added 2025-01-22 - Global Solar Power Tracker, Global Energy Monitor and TransitionZero, June 2024 release https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-integrated-power-tracker/

Global-Wind-Power-Tracker-June-2024.xlsx - Global Energy Monitor - added 2025-01-22 - Global Energy Monitor, Global Wind Power Tracker, June 2024 release https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-integrated-power-tracker/

windsolar_gipt_aus_checked.csv - Ruby Stephens - updated 2025-02-24 - data on locations, capacity and start year of wind and solar facilities located across Australia. Original list from the Global Energy Monitor manually checked and updated using project websites and Google Earth. Only projects above 3MW capacity included.

wind_solar_biodiversity_sysreview... - Ruby Stephens and Malan Bothma - added 2024-12 - updated 2025-08-21 - systematic review data entered by Ruby Stephens and Malan Bothma

Global-Wind-Power-Tracker-February-2025 - Global Energy Monitor - added 2025-08-22 - data on locations and capacity of global utility-scale wind power facilities to create a global map 

Global-Solar-Power-Tracker-February-2025 - Global Energy Monitor - added 2025-08-22 - data on locations and capacity of global utility-scale solar power facilities to create a global map 